idual|token_occurrence|state_assertion|token_causal_claim|attitude|predicted_occurrence|prediction_error):[0-9a-f]{64}\$",\n      "description": "a reference by identity to ANY content object, INCLUDING another attitude (nesting: A believes that B believes X). The content records what the holder\'s mind contains, not what is true - it may be FALSE, and a content that contradicts the actual record raises NO conflict (Rule 25: that mismatch IS a false belief, first-class and shareable)"\n    }\n  }\n}\n',
